%% Context: Retail returns workflow for eligibility, inspection, and customer resolution.
flowchart LR
  A([Return requested]) --> B[Validate order and return window]
  B --> C{Return eligible?}
  C -->|No| D([Reject return])
  C -->|Yes| E[Issue return label]
  E --> F[Receive returned item]
  F --> G[Inspect condition]
  G --> H{Item resellable?}
  H -->|Yes| I[(Restock inventory)]
  H -->|No| J[Scrap or recycle item]
  I --> K{Customer requested replacement?}
  J --> K
  K -->|Yes| L[[Create replacement shipment]]
  L --> M([Replacement dispatched])
  K -->|No| N[Refund original payment]
  N --> O{Refund accepted?}
  O -->|Yes| P([Refund confirmed])
  O -->|No| Q[Investigate payment exception]
  Q -.-> N
